  "body": "- The link options destination is always a \"destination type\" (never `null`)\r\n- We only use the \"preload\" translating of `as` when it's a preload.\r\n- An invalid \"as\" translates to null, and returns early from attempting to preload. This does not affect other link types.\r\n- The default remains the empty string, and rel=icon can set the request's destination manually to `image` as before.\r\n\r\nCloses #11726\r\n",
